; GTA SA main.txt compatibility library for OpenSCM.
; This file intentionally leaves main.txt in place and includes it at the end.
; Core SCML control-flow forms are mapped to real SCML opcodes. GTA-specific
; commands are dispatched through native CALLs so a host can implement their
; real game behavior without changing the language or VM.
;
; Required host natives for full behavior:
;   GTA_COMMAND(command_name) -> result/condition integer in $RETVAL
;   GTA_NOT()               -> inverted/negated condition integer in $RETVAL
; The stock CLI has no GTA host registered; use it to compile this bridge,
; then run the bytecode from an embedding that registers those natives.
macro $10031(__scml_ignored):
    CALL "GTA_COMMAND" "$10031"
    0004: $GTA_LAST_CONDITION $RETVAL
endmacro
macro $10055(__scml_ignored):
    CALL "GTA_COMMAND" "$10055"
    0004: $GTA_LAST_CONDITION $RETVAL
endmacro
